Python Version Required: 3.10 or higher
Recommended: Python 3.11 or 3.12

Check your version with this command:
python --version

If your version is below 3.10, download the latest:
https://www.python.org/downloads/

Tested on:
- Python 3.11.5 (Windows)
- Python 3.12.0 (Mac)
- Python 3.10.12 (Linux)
